 "publishedAt": "2025-12-02T10:58:56Z",
 "excerpt": "Drilling in the city is not just about making a hole in the ground. Managing cuttings, drilling mud, water and general site cleanliness is a major issue for neighbours, local authorities and the project owner.",
 "category": "chantier",
